<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/reference-link/LINK-SW17-07EA13615A6E> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "An automated semibatch platform dispenses reagents with Tri-Continent C3000 syringe pumps and measures products with an Ocean Optics Flame spectrometer. A custom15-vial Geneva-wheel platform evolves gold nanospheres and nanorods, then uses optimized rods as seeds for octahedral gold nanoparticles. The exact Flame detector/grating configuration is unspecified." .
