<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/reference-link/LINK-SW17-3963962AAA4D> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Source reports this apparatus type in its manufacturing or characterization workflow. Atomized salt precursors become refractory-metal oxide nanoparticles, which are charged, mobility-selected and collected. TSI9302 atomizer,3077 charge neutralizer and3085 DMA are explicitly named. Reduction produces metal catalysts for substrate CVD or floating-catalyst CVD SWCNT growth. TSI3756 condensation particle counter measures aerosol concentrations. Unnamed furnace and collection assemblies must remain class-level." .
<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/reference-link/LINK-SW17-3963962AAA4D> <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#relation> "supports_claim" .
