<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/reference-link/LINK-SW17-3C5652DA8FB4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Source reports this apparatus type in its manufacturing or characterization workflow. Electrospinning a hydroxyapatite/PAN precursor followed by nitrogen-atmosphere carbonization produces hydroxyapatite-containing carbon nanofibers. The BTF-1200C vacuum tube furnace is expressly named. Further preparation incorporates myoglobin and Nafion into an electrode coating. The electrospinner is not identified by make/model." .
<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/reference-link/LINK-SW17-3C5652DA8FB4> <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/ontology#relation> "supports_claim" .
