<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/reference-link/LINK-SW17-BD3CA629F75D> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> <https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/reference/REF-85D684544148> .
