<https://github.com/PodComet/ICoN-PCL-Equipment-Metadata/id/reference-link/LINK-SW17-D3CAF0783178> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Source reports this apparatus type in its manufacturing or characterization workflow. Repeated phosphorus insertion and oxidative extraction converts Pd seed nanocrystals to hollow Pd nanoshells. The authors describe heated magnetic stirring, centrifugation/washing and unspecified sonication. Repeating the conversion enlarges voids and thins shells. Atmosphere and temperature alter the observed morphology; this is a reported study result, not an app prediction." .
